 "Last Update": "最后更新",
 "Getting started": "入门",
 "What is FMS?": "什么是 FMS？",
 "FMS is a fund management platform. It brings together fund information, NAV history, investor holdings, trading, back office and reporting in one place.": "FMS 是一个基金管理平台，将基金信息、净值历史、投资者持仓、交易、后台和报告集中在一处。",
 "Is the data real?": "数据是真实的吗？",
 "No. All funds, prices, investors and market data in this demo are simulated. They are only meant to show how the platform works.": "不是。本演示中的所有基金、价格、投资者和市场数据均为模拟数据，仅用于展示平台的工作方式。",
 "How do I create an account?": "如何创建账户？",
 "Open the Sign up tab on the sign-in screen and fill in the form. An administrator reviews each new account and activates it with the right role.": "在登录界面打开“注册”标签并填写表格。管理员会审核每个新账户，并分配相应角色后激活。",
 "What can each role do?": "每个角色能做什么？",
 "Investors and introducers see funds, markets, reports and their own portfolio. Fund traders also trade and price. Fund managers add management, transactions, dividends and commissions. The super administrator sees everything, including users and supervision.": "投资者和介绍人可查看基金、市场、报告和自己的投资组合。基金交易员还可以交易和定价。基金经理增加管理、交易记录、分红和佣金。超级管理员可查看全部内容，包括用户和监管。",
 "How do I change the language or theme?": "如何更改语言或主题？",
 "Click the options icon at the top right. You can switch between English, Vietnamese, French and Chinese, and between the dark and light themes.": "点击右上角的选项图标。您可以在英文、越南文、法文和中文之间切换，也可以在深色和浅色主题之间切换。",
 "Funds and NAV": "基金与净值",
 "What is the NAV?": "什么是净值（NAV）？",
 "The net asset value is the value of a fund's assets minus its liabilities, divided by the number of units. It is the price at which units are subscribed and redeemed.": "资产净值是基金资产减去负债后除以份额数得出的价值，也是申购和赎回份额时使用的价格。",
 "How often is the NAV updated?": "净值多久更新一次？",
 "Each fund has its own valuation frequency, shown on its detail page. Staff manage valuations on the NAV & Pricing page.": "每只基金都有自己的估值频率，显示在基金详情页上。工作人员在“净值与定价”页面管理估值。",
 "How is fund performance calculated?": "基金业绩如何计算？",
 "Performance is the change in NAV per unit over the period, with dividends taken into account. The YTD, 1-year and other periods all start from the last NAV before the period.": "业绩是期间内每份净值的变化，并计入分红。年初至今、1 年及其他期间均从期间开始前的最近一次净值起算。",
 "What is the benchmark on the performance chart?": "业绩图上的基准是什么？",
 "It is the index the fund is compared with. By default it is the VN-Index for Vietnam funds and the S&P 500 for global funds. You can choose another one from the list above the chart.": "基准是用来与基金比较的指数。越南基金默认使用 VN 指数，全球基金默认使用标普 500。您可以在图表上方的列表中选择其他指数。",
 "How do I compare several funds?": "如何比较多只基金？",
 "Open Funds, then Compare funds. Pick the funds and the period to see their performance and key figures side by side.": "打开“基金”，然后选择“比较基金”。选择基金和期间，即可并排查看它们的业绩和关键数据。",
 "Investing": "投资",
 "How do I subscribe to a fund?": "如何申购基金？",
 "Open My Portfolio, then the New order tab. Choose the fund, select Subscribe and enter an amount. The order is dealt at the NAV of the next dealing day.": "打开“我的投资组合”，然后进入“新订单”标签。选择基金，选择“申购”并输入金额。订单按下一个交易日的净值成交。",
 "How do I redeem my units?": "如何赎回份额？",
 "In the New order tab of My Portfolio, select Redeem and enter a number of units. The cash is paid after settlement, at the NAV of the dealing day. A pending order can still be cancelled.": "在“我的投资组合”的“新订单”标签中选择“赎回”并输入份额数。资金在结算后按交易日净值支付。等待中的订单仍可取消。",
 "Why is my order still pending?": "为什么我的订单仍在等待中？",
 "Orders are processed on the fund's next dealing day and then checked by the back office. Until then the status stays pending. You can follow it in My Operations.": "订单在基金的下一个交易日处理，然后由后台核对。在此之前状态保持为等待中。您可以在“我的操作”中跟踪。",
 "Where can I see my holdings and dividends?": "在哪里查看我的持仓和分红？",
 "Open the account menu at the top right. My Funds shows your holdings, My Operations your orders, and My Dividends every dividend you received.": "打开右上角的账户菜单。“我的基金”显示持仓，“我的操作”显示订单，“我的分红”显示收到的每一笔分红。",
 "Are there fees?": "有费用吗？",
 "Each fund lists its management fee, performance fee and ongoing charges on its detail page. These fees are already taken into account in the published NAV.": "每只基金在详情页上列出管理费、业绩报酬和持续费用。这些费用已计入公布的净值。",
 "Reports and data": "报告与数据",
 "How do I download a report?": "如何下载报告？",
 "Open Reports, choose the report and its options, then click Download. Click View to open it in a new browser tab instead.": "打开“报告”，选择报告及其选项，然后点击“下载”。点击“查看”可在新的浏览器标签页中打开。",
 "What does the file name under a table mean?": "表格下方的文件名是什么意思？",
 "It names the data file in data/rds that the table reads. Update that file to change what the table shows.": "它表示该表格读取的 data/rds 中的数据文件。更新该文件即可更改表格显示的内容。",
 "When is market data updated?": "市场数据何时更新？",
 "The Markets page shows closing levels and the time of the last update at the top right of the movers cards.": "“市场”页面显示收盘水平，并在涨跌卡片右上角显示最后更新时间。",
 "Account and security": "账户与安全",
 "How do I change my password?": "如何修改密码？",
 "Open My Profile from the account menu at the top right and use the password section.": "从右上角的账户菜单打开“我的资料”，使用密码部分进行修改。",
 "I forgot my password. What should I do?": "我忘记了密码，该怎么办？",
 "Contact your administrator. They can reset it from the Users page.": "请联系管理员，管理员可以在“用户”页面重置密码。",
 "Who can see my personal information?": "谁能看到我的个人信息？",
 "Only you and authorised staff. Every change made by staff is recorded in the audit log.": "只有您本人和获授权的工作人员。工作人员所做的每项更改都会记录在审计日志中。",
 "FAQ": "常见问题",
 "Answers to common questions about FMS, funds, investing and your account.": "关于 FMS、基金、投资和您的账户的常见问题解答。",
 "Search the questions": "搜索问题",
 "No question matches your search.": "没有与您的搜索匹配的问题。",
 "AUM": "资产管理规模（AUM）",
 "Assets under management: the total market value of everything a fund holds for its investors.": "基金为投资者持有的全部资产的市值总额。",
 "An index used to measure a fund's performance, such as the VN-Index or the S&P 500.": "用于衡量基金业绩的指数，例如 VN 指数或标普 500。",
 "Cut-off time": "截止时间",
 "The latest time an order can be placed to be dealt on the next dealing day.": "订单在下一个交易日成交所需的最晚下单时间。",
 "Dealing day": "交易日",
 "A day on which the fund accepts subscriptions and redemptions at that day's NAV.": "基金按当日净值接受申购和赎回的日子。",
 "A payment of income from the fund to its investors, also called a dividend.": "基金向投资者支付的收益，也称为分红。",
 "The fall from a peak NAV to a later low. The maximum drawdown is the largest such fall over a period.": "净值从高点到其后低点的跌幅。最大回撤是期间内最大的跌幅。",
 "High-water mark": "高水位线",
 "The highest NAV on which a performance fee was paid. A new fee is due only above it.": "已支付业绩报酬的最高净值。只有超过该水平才会收取新的业绩报酬。",
 "A partner who brings investors to the funds and earns a commission on their investments.": "为基金引荐投资者并按其投资获得佣金的合作伙伴。",
 "ISIN": "ISIN",
 "International Securities Identification Number: the 12-character code that identifies a fund share class.": "国际证券识别码：识别基金份额类别的 12 位代码。",
 "The yearly fee paid to the fund manager, as a percentage of the fund's assets.": "按基金资产百分比每年支付给基金经理的费用。",
 "Net asset value: the fund's assets minus its liabilities. NAV per unit divides it by the units in issue.": "资产净值：基金资产减去负债。每份净值为其除以已发行份额数。",
 "All the yearly costs of running a fund, shown as a percentage of its assets.": "运营基金的全部年度成本，以资产百分比表示。",
 "A fee paid to the manager when the fund beats its target, usually above a high-water mark.": "基金超越目标时支付给经理的费用，通常需超过高水位线。",
 "Bringing a portfolio's holdings back to their target weights.": "将投资组合的持仓调整回目标权重。",
 "Selling units back to the fund at the NAV of the dealing day.": "按交易日净值将份额卖回给基金。",
 "The step that completes an order, when cash and units actually change hands.": "完成订单的步骤，即资金和份额实际交割。",
 "Sharpe ratio": "夏普比率",
 "Return above the risk-free rate divided by volatility. Higher means more return for each unit of risk.": "超出无风险利率的收益除以波动率。数值越高，每单位风险的收益越多。",
 "Buying new units of a fund at the NAV of the dealing day.": "按交易日净值购买基金的新份额。",
 "Unit": "份额",
 "A share of a fund. Each unit is worth the NAV per unit.": "基金的一份。每份价值等于每份净值。",
 "How much returns move up and down, measured as the annualised standard deviation.": "收益上下波动的程度，以年化标准差衡量。",
 "Withholding tax": "预扣税",
 "Tax deducted at source from a dividend before it is paid. FMS applies 5%.": "分红支付前从源头扣除的税款。FMS 按 5% 扣除。",
 "Year to date: the change from the last NAV of the previous year until today.": "从上一年最后一次净值到今天的变化。",
 "Help": "帮助",
 "Glossary": "术语表",
 "Key fund and investment terms used across FMS.": "FMS 中使用的主要基金和投资术语。",
 "Search the glossary": "搜索术语",
 "No term matches your search.": "没有与您的搜索匹配的术语。",
 "Accounts: superadmin, fund manager, trader, introducers and investors, with profile, role, status and fund access.": "账户：超级管理员、基金经理、交易员、介绍人和投资者，包括资料、角色、状态和基金访问权限。",
 "Sign-in tokens kept for 'remember me' (empty in the demo).": "为“记住我”保存的登录令牌（演示中为空）。",
 "The funds: code, name, country (GLOBAL / VIETNAM), selection, strategy, currency, benchmark and manager.": "基金：代码、名称、国家（GLOBAL / VIETNAM）、精选、策略、货币、基准和经理。",
 "Legal and dealing terms per fund: ISIN, structure, service providers, fees, cut-off and risk limits.": "每只基金的法律和交易条款：ISIN、结构、服务机构、费用、截止时间和风险限额。",
 "Daily NAV per unit, total NAV and units outstanding per fund.": "每只基金每日的每份净值、总净值和流通份额。",
 "Today's indicative NAV (iNAV) every 5 minutes per fund.": "每只基金当日每 5 分钟的参考净值（iNAV）。",
 "Futures held by each fund: contract, sector, exchange, sleeve, contracts, price and margin.": "每只基金持有的期货：合约、行业、交易所、分组、合约数、价格和保证金。",
 "Fund documents (factsheets, KID, prospectus, reports) with type, date, pages and language.": "基金文件（概况、KID、招募说明书、报告），包括类型、日期、页数和语言。",
 "Daily closing values of each fund's benchmark index.": "每只基金基准指数的每日收盘值。",
 "Market instruments shown on the Markets page: symbol, name, asset class, region, unit.": "“市场”页面显示的品种：代码、名称、资产类别、地区、单位。",
 "Daily closes for each market instrument.": "每个市场品种的每日收盘价。",
 "Daily FX rates (pair such as EURUSD) used to convert AUM to USD.": "用于将资产规模换算为美元的每日汇率（如 EURUSD）。",
 "Investor subscriptions and redemptions: dates, amount, units, NAV, fee and status.": "投资者的申购和赎回：日期、金额、份额、净值、费用和状态。",
 "Trader orders on futures: side, contracts, type, limit, fills, status and trader.": "交易员的期货订单：方向、合约数、类型、限价、成交、状态和交易员。",
 "Dividends declared to investors: record and payment dates, per unit, gross, tax and net.": "向投资者宣布的分红：登记日和支付日、每份金额、总额、税款和净额。",
 "Introducer commissions per investor, fund and month: basis, rate, amount and status.": "介绍人按投资者、基金和月份计算的佣金：计算基础、费率、金额和状态。",
 "Who did what and when (approvals, rebalances, fills, sign-ins).": "谁在何时做了什么（审批、再平衡、成交、登录）。",
 "Data table structure": "数据表结构",
