 "Write to us or send a request for information. We answer by e-mail or phone.": "给我们写信或发送信息咨询。我们会通过电子邮件或电话回复。",
 "Guides and references for FMS. View them in a new tab or download them to read offline and print.": "FMS 的指南和参考资料。可在新标签页中查看，或下载后离线阅读和打印。",
 "How FMS is organised and what each part of the menu does.": "FMS 的结构以及菜单各部分的用途。",
 "Every frequently asked question with its answer, on one page.": "在一页上列出所有常见问题及答案。",
 "Every database table with its fields, types and an example.": "每个数据库表及其字段、类型和示例。",
 "General question": "一般问题",
 "Fund information": "基金信息",
 "Investing and orders": "投资与订单",
 "My account": "我的账户",
 "Technical problem": "技术问题",
 "Information requests sent from Help > Contact: topic, fund, subject, message, how to reply and status.": "从“帮助 > 联系”发送的信息咨询：主题、基金、标题、内容、回复方式和状态。",
 "Signing in": "登录",
 "Operations and risk": "运营与风险",
 "Reports and calendar": "报告与日历",
 "Sign in with your e-mail and password. New users sign up on the same screen; an administrator approves each account and gives it a role. The options icon at the top right changes the language and the light or dark theme.": "使用电子邮件和密码登录。新用户在同一界面注册，管理员审核每个账户并分配角色。右上角的选项图标可切换语言以及浅色或深色主题。",
 "The dashboard sums up the funds you can see: assets under management, the best performers over several periods and the latest NAV of each fund.": "仪表板汇总您可查看的基金：资产管理规模、各期间表现最佳的基金以及每只基金的最新净值。",
 "Fund list shows every fund with its NAV, performance and components. Click a fund to open its detail page: overview, performance against a benchmark you choose, composition, documents and terms. Compare funds puts several funds side by side, and the Documents library holds every fund document.": "基金列表显示每只基金的净值、业绩和成分。点击基金可打开详情页：概览、相对所选基准的业绩、组合、文件和条款。“比较基金”可并排查看多只基金，“文件库”收录所有基金文件。",
 "Markets shows closing levels for indices, commodities, forex, rates and crypto, the top gainers and losers of the day, and a chart of any instrument. FX rates lists the rates used to convert amounts to USD.": "“市场”显示指数、商品、外汇、利率和加密货币的收盘水平、当日涨跌幅最大的品种以及任一品种的图表。“汇率”列出换算为美元所用的汇率。",
 "Investors place subscription and redemption orders from My Portfolio, in the New order tab. Orders are dealt at the NAV of the next dealing day once the back office approves them. My Funds, My Operations and My Dividends in the account menu show holdings, orders and dividends.": "投资者在“我的投资组合”的“新订单”标签中提交申购和赎回订单。后台批准后，订单按下一个交易日的净值成交。账户菜单中的“我的基金”“我的操作”和“我的分红”分别显示持仓、订单和分红。",
 "Staff manage the funds from the Operations menu: management, trading, back office, transactions, NAV and pricing, dividends and commissions. The Risk menu covers exposure and compliance checks. Each role sees only the pages it can use.": "工作人员通过“运营”菜单管理基金：管理、交易、后台、交易记录、净值与定价、分红和佣金。“风险”菜单涵盖敞口和合规检查。每个角色只能看到其可使用的页面。",
 "Reports offers each report as a CSV download or as a page to view and print. The calendar shows dividends, document publications, rebalancing days, month-end valuations and orders waiting to deal.": "“报告”可将每份报告下载为 CSV 文件，或以页面形式查看和打印。日历显示分红、文件发布、再平衡日、月末估值以及等待成交的订单。",
 "Help holds the FAQ, the glossary, the structure of the data tables, these documents and the contact page, where you can send a request for information.": "“帮助”包含常见问题、术语表、数据表结构、这些文件以及联系页面，您可以在联系页面发送信息咨询。",
 "Remember me": "记住我",
